# Added by Cargo
# Contains all compiled binaries, build artifacts, and dependencies
/target/

# Remove this macro if you are writing a library that other projects depend on.
# For binaries/apps, keep it committed to ensure reproducible builds.
Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt when fixing code formatting
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows build debugging files
*.pdb

# Cargo Mutants (mutation testing data tool)
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc internal compiler error stack dump files
rustc-ice-*.txt

# Both the transfer journal and the staging file it is renamed in from
last_execution_manifest.json*
photo_cache.db
profiles.json
